From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GDmio <zhalin66@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 15:14:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] BlueOS: SetupWizard: Keep the brand color after setup

LineageOS switches a preset color source to wallpaper colors when setup finishes. BlueOS' default is a preset (brand color), so leave it.

Change-Id: Ie309bf4ea4534540b99e4849436c0d500bc80a9e
---
 .../java/org/lineageos/setupwizard/util/SetupWizardUtils.kt    | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/setupwizard/util/SetupWizardUtils.kt b/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/setupwizard/util/SetupWizardUtils.kt
index 69d99cd..5fd772a 100644
--- a/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/setupwizard/util/SetupWizardUtils.kt
+++ b/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/setupwizard/util/SetupWizardUtils.kt
@@ -214,7 +214,8 @@ object SetupWizardUtils {
                     "This should not happen!",
             )
         }
-        restoreWallpaperColorSource(contentResolver)
+        // BlueOS: keep the default preset (brand color "Голубой BA", framework theming_defaults)
+        // instead of switching to wallpaper colors with restoreWallpaperColorSource()
         Settings.Secure.putInt(contentResolver, Settings.Secure.USER_SETUP_COMPLETE, 1)
         if (hasLeanback(context)) {
             Settings.Secure.putInt(contentResolver, Settings.Secure.TV_USER_SETUP_COMPLETE, 1)
